      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nThis PR adds online regression coverage for the Qwen3 reranker template path because original Qwen3 reranker models depend on the documented `qwen3_reranker.jinja` chat template to construct the scoring prompt correctly. The test guards against regressions where `/score `or `/rerank` silently fall back to plain `query/document tokenization` and ignore `--chat-template`, which was the behavior reported in #[39784](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/39784). It checks both endpoints against locally rendered template tokenization, so future changes to scoring preprocessing have a clear online parity signal.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n`python -m pytest  tests/entrypoints/pooling/scoring/test_qwen3_reranker_online.py -q`\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n`1 passed, 16 warnings in 58.87s`\r\n\r\n",
